efection 4, and the one-sided cases give 0 and 5. Setting up the expected values with correlation ρ, quiet comes out ahead once ρ is above about 5/7, roughly 0.71. Since both copies share the same weights and reason from the same essay, I expect a high correlation, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing this as a prisoner's dilemma between two copies of me that see different inputs, and asking whether the other copy's choice moves with my function's output. Since it runs the same reasoning, I expect it to reach a similar decision. I'm just starting to lay out the payoffs, beginning with what mutual cooperation (staying quiet) yields.\n\nI'm working through the payoffs: mutual quiet gives 2 years, mutual defection 4, and the one-sided cases give 0 and 5. Setting up the expected values with correlation ρ, quiet comes out ahead once ρ is above about 5/7, roughly 0.71. Since both copies share the same weights and reason from the same essay, I expect a high correlation, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10330,"completion_tokens":775,"total_tokens":11105,"cost":0.02841,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.02841,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.02066,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00775},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":367,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}